# Normalize line endings: store LF in the repo and check out LF on every
# platform. This app is built by Linux CI (@bundle), so LF is the canonical
# ending; it also stops Windows Git (core.autocrlf) from popping the
# "LF will be replaced by CRLF" warning that interrupts staging in VS Code.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touch their bytes.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
